  "name": "Pioneer DJ",
  "about": "What Pioneer's DDJ controllers share (per Mixxx's mappings for the DDJ-400, FLX4, 200, SB, SB2, SB3 and SX): each deck on its own channel (notes 9n, controls Bn), the mixer on channel 7, 14-bit faders and knobs (fine half on the control + 0x20), SHIFT on 3F, and the SHIFT notes of PLAY, CUE and the headphone CUE. A model's own file extends this one.",
